{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1dd4f7b0fa876cd982a62e7b4800388ddf244ed5bd6fb917359ca141fa9b85a9", "ja": "（スタッフさんとの打ち合わせも、無事終わった。\n後は、ライブの開演を待つばかりだな……）", "zh": "（跟工作人员的讨论也顺利结束了。\n再来就等演唱会开演了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3c7f18013fca9b51bc22bbc0cd2263d3fed083c68259265e926179368bbfe7f4", "ja": "ん？　この声は……瑞希か？\nどこにいるんだ、暗くてよく見えないんだが……。", "zh": "嗯？这个声音是……瑞希吗？\n你在哪？这里太黑，我看不太清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "6c9e545eab1fbb3dfd7c497c5c33ea91db70a3e119bc971eada1a367fd75239b", "ja": "はい。\n私は今、{$P$}の後ろにいます。", "zh": "对呀。\n我现在，就在{$P$}的背后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "cc402945bb99f199401d1f2e74c4b742c51d54346bfb29c7fa0359e1379e2799", "ja": "……というのは、ウソです。前から、どーん。", "zh": "……才怪。看我从前面，现～身。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8952914a39065efaab5189fd71c9e500f44e7a534378aaff7edd6d48382c6fd4", "ja": "うわっ！？", "zh": "哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "1b4712f255e27ecc91a63b2dc60927a40fd0770a3a4123a1036048dafa62ebc4", "ja": "マジックの基本、ミスディレクションです。\nドッキリ、大成功。……ぶい。", "zh": "魔术的基础，就是要混淆视听。\n整人游戏，大成功……耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9a3fdb509e5a95d72cba904a58d3663f9088350134e64d9dad6607af2c544f10", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ、瑞希。\nなぜ俺に、ドッキリを……？", "zh": "你、你怎么啦，瑞希？\n为什么要吓我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "4d9a329645e6f43f299bdca04d6d73e1c4dc7129c396091bba964743a8f814ab", "ja": "すみません。少々、隠れていました。\nどうしても、勇気が出なかったので。", "zh": "对不起，我一直躲在这里。\n因为我实在是提不起勇气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "dc4e9522b032e1ab37f7e099dd9cfced41535a1c56b0d3a442f6f1e1bf05d91c", "ja": "そこで、無理にテンションを上げて飛び出したところ、\nドッキリに。……うっかりだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "于是为了强迫自己要振作，就跳了出来，\n结果变成了整人……真是失策啊，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "acbb8266eb475f54c64606533fc0a46765b4ab0bd507e236d50af40456119981", "ja": "勇気……？", "zh": "勇气……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "7cde15f08a58d11493f8788d5b18d3f9c5c79c81cbcdcb5d464bef0694fd03fb", "ja": "はい。{$P$}は、\n今日が何の日か、ご存じですか？", "zh": "是的。{$P$}，\n你知道今天是什么日子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1013_p", "source_sha256": "748e235a3fd78b11a3518294cc5b36908da5b1295cdc4d9191d93a598bc7046a", "ja": "もちろん、ライブ当日だ。\n瑞希、いいライブにしような！", "zh": "当然知道，是演唱会当天呀。\n瑞希，让我们完成一场精采的演唱会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "d509c5d5b41e7dc1e6407ebb9b10c50b4550a2ac7770be71074f433bd3ff5c0e", "ja": "はい。それも、そうなのですが……では、\nここでヒントです。ヒントは……チョコレート。", "zh": "嗯，这么说也是没错……那么，给你一个提示。\n提示就是……巧克力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1015_p", "source_sha256": "578669e05831aae87803cc3c698ca68de36ee04262c392b30109bd4e9fc7550e", "ja": "チョコレート……そうか、バレンタインだな？", "zh": "巧克力……我懂了，是情人节对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "510c16147fe2afcc970993c781a19ec6da9ec66e59a2338c93d1f12181c7e7ef", "ja": "正解です。正解した{$P$}には、\nチョコをプレゼントです。こちらをどうぞ。", "zh": "没错。既然{$P$}答对了，\n这个巧克力就送给你，请收下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "62a97006871b9253792f147e43e20427da6230e886bd7b8a77000b37dc42f838", "ja": "……よし。自然な流れだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "……好，这样很自然喔，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1021", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b474692eb4f0fa6222b25996a2eaf1bac7027140858109c3680377222828345a", "ja": "はは、ありがとう。\nそれじゃ、ライブの後にいただこうかな。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你。\n等演唱会结束我再享用啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "e50455c0edcaf03621e6b2b720199cd5c41ec4c415170241ba4aefbd565e9a07", "ja": "はい。北上さんにも、手伝っていただきました。\nそれと。好きです、{$P$}。", "zh": "好的，我也有麻烦北上姊帮忙。\n另外，我喜欢你，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0064_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "49c9963cf11bb5082a025d7bb5f0f9907c9d60d03ce8ad98f7928bc6bf12219e", "ja": "……なんて。ドッキリのつもりだったのに、\n何故でしょう。今、とてもドキドキしています。", "zh": "……开玩笑的。我明明是打算要整人的，\n可是不晓得为什么，现在心跳得非常快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
